WZTWRZUPGW-F7F_CYviKp2IGyWqtEdgj-NNbRHBaBv-M9R9DQXKyw_-LoUyA3KHjqIIbTiJr70Jg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y8o_aXb8tfVFjYJiCdz3qAf4pXJGgxSorXDSKqw9AMVpdzv98hpL4-SiKxyfODjaPOtU1HY6_dGg28u--akF\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yz0Qa5YEn5VVXZ2PmB74ZCMnJ6FRNFTsYRH-9es617SGcDqZVdFF03c-5gD6XIr_s6FNWTIiffmyicPeHWae\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gLRbwS_5wESuJV263HjWZ9GAYkrSbh3qUkGpqAdKpCNpB7oWTvKvR3qOtto1WaLBQla-R97eWMFc_NSJNP8zDec\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8Twwx-UN-cTVBpaP1clB2zsPejQ7C1Df9taPesMuda6fyooD2vdHGUjZ7E9TE9Z_usuEz3zjGqDKBIoIoDGxQA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/okjjJ2E_DEWZTWRZUPGW-F7F_CYviKp2IGyWqtEdgj-NNbRHBaBv-M9R9DQXKyw_-LoUyA3KHjqIIbTiJr70Jg\"]]],\"Bus Fever Party!\",[\"4.5\",4.4545455],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIAEoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBFwoVCKrvlOCM/IqOQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI1Ch8KGWdyaWRwbHVzLmJ1c2phbS5jYXJwdXp6bGUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Bus Fever Party! – Ultimate Color Sorting Puzzle Game!\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready for the addictive color sort traffic jam challenge! The parking lot was blocked by buses and cars. Can you clear the chaos and become a color parking master? If you love brain-teasing color match challenges, sorting puzzles, and solving complex car jam escapes, this game is your choice! 🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW TO PLAY THE COLOR MATCH CHALLENGE\\u003cbr\\u003eYour mission is to clear the lanes and match passengers with their correct buses:\\u003cbr\\u003e🚦 Tap to Move Cars: Navigate the gridlock by shifting cars to free up lanes for the buses.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚌 Color Match and Sort: Match passengers waiting at the station to the bus of the exact same color.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 Clear the Bus Jam: Strategically move vehicles into the parking slots. But watch your space! Don\\u0026#39;t let your slots get blocked.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Win the Level: Sort every passenger and clear all buses—now your\\u0026#39;re the color parking master!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 WHY YOU WILL LOVE THIS COLOR SORT PUZZLE\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Vibrant Visual Sorting: Enjoy beautifully designed 3D tile textures that make every level feel like a relaxing car coloring art session.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Smarter Brain Puzzles: Train your logical thinking with complex color matching layouts. Every move matters!\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ Helpful Boosters: Stuck in a tight traffic jam? Use powerful boosters to clear blocked roads and keep the flow moving.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏁 BECOME THE COLOR PARKING MASTER!\\u003cbr\\u003eConquer thousands of levels of pure bus sorting fun. Whether you want to relax with a satisfying color match game or challenge your brain with a tricky color sort traffic jam, we have it all!\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Bus Fever Party now and prove you are the smartest coordinator in the parking lot! 🚌🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCONTACT\\u003cbr\\u003e📧 lumigamesteam@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003e📞 +447871573653\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/pp-of-lumi-games/home\\u003cbr\\u003eEULA: https://sites.google.com/view/eula-of-lumi-games/home\"],\"Lumi Games\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/No9bLxZkFM_V3zOjgBH_WfmYBfydxQtdpEzBAlMWmJxrEOo_y9G-6Jw1GpRvKW6Cedrc64NgFC_Fe8N658HH\"],null,[111,202,254,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[n