dDyXThOfsH9EaqVulg44CupdxnKIrLlxdIvhJpHtK4InDReuhnL1GFdl4-ULKMPel0F8S52uoJm_AkP9fUuKcJoELYAu-szFV25OlTJxvZCOF_2lj3zQu-7gIgABIgoH5Mz8psBw_mCwty-mOJGJ8kMKdH7hNamaka91q13aVJiW0yvIJTADMgYREkZqakC_yL3p7eMcVyeg-jSHb-KE9EECawT9PLG2OpLKsabltgWIOXVkYvQm8PU_Q\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3pu8nD2q5IE/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Hole.io, the wildly satisfying eat-the-world game played by millions! Drop into busy New York, a creaky pirate cove, or a glowing sci-fi metropolis - and swallow it whole. Cars, lampposts, hot dogs and even giant skyscrapers! 🏙️🏴\\u200d☠️🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;ve got five minutes while watching your favorite show or an hour to unwind before bed, just tap, glide, and watch the city crumble into a black hole. No pressure, no stress - just the pure, oddly relaxing joy of eating everything in sight. 😌\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍔 EAT EVERYTHING\\u003cbr\\u003eStart tiny, barely big enough to swallow a trash can. Grow huge, big enough to gulp down skyscrapers in one bite. The bigger you get, the louder the crunch. Pure satisfaction. 🌆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😌 THE PERFECT BREAK \\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to learn, instantly satisfying. Play in short bursts: morning coffee ☕, lunch break 🥪, evening unwind🌙. A relaxing, oddly soothing game for casual players.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ WHY YOU\\u0026#39;LL LOVE IT \\u003cbr\\u003e- Wonderfully simple controls - just swipe and glide.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Insanely satisfying gameplay - swallow, smash, and clear the map.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Beautiful, vibrant 3D worlds packed with detail.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Free to play, easy to love.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🕳️ Ready to swallow the world? Download Hole.io now and find out why millions of players can\\u0026#39;t put it down. Time to feed the black hole. 😋\"],\"VOODOO\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.goog