KLhAnwC0RfQ90DkLvYS8MU2bkFreA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GdGBu4havrvquHJfCqMB41EAbQj5G8MroR_uu1hXegIHTurrRzeM0wvYjJRHlWDnhmiUZk84In7HQWy6ke3p_98\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2rblLrpb5silrLhRLq249IM7cKem2e-jwFWvqOQwtaGcvyK_Pr6LbUcdAii4FzptHGEqnIshtuYY4vfW_303\"]]],\"Offline Games: No WiFi - FunOn\",[\"4.6\",4.61],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IDkoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgocChZjb20ubWVkaWE3MjAuZ2FtZXMyMDIwEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Looking for a relaxing and entertaining way to pass the time without an internet connection? \\u0026quot;100+ Offline Games No WiFi Fun\\u0026quot; offers a carefully curated collection of puzzles and games designed to keep you engaged and entertained wherever you are. Whether you\\u0026#39;re traveling, commuting, or just unwinding at home, this app delivers endless offline fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Choose This App?\\u003cbr\\u003eHuge Selection of Games: Enjoy over 100 diverse puzzles and challenges, ranging from classic card games to creative brainteasers.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo Internet Required: Play anytime, anywhere without worrying about connectivity or data usage.\\u003cbr\\u003eEngaging for All Ages: Perfect for fans of strategy, logic, and casual games, with options for every preference.\\u003cbr\\u003eSeamless Experience: Optimized for smooth performance and minimal battery drain, ensuring hassle-free play.\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eWide Variety of Puzzles: From classics like Solitaire to innovative block challenges, there’s something for everyone.\\u003cbr\\u003eOffline Gameplay: Enjoy your favorite puzzles without needing WiFi or mobile data.\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenging and Rewarding Levels: Test your skills with levels designed to keep you entertained and motivated.\\u003cbr\\u003eFresh Content: Regular updates bring new games and puzzles to explore.\\u003cbr\\u003eHigh-Quality Visuals: Vibrant graphics and animations make each game visually appealing and enjoyable.\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Highlights:\\u003cbr\\u003eBlock Challenges: Strategize and clear the board with fun and engaging block puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003eSolitaire and Variants: Master timeless card games with exciting twists.\\u003cbr\\u003eCreative Puzzles: Enjoy unique challenges designed to stimulate your mind and provide hours of entertainment.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat Sets It Apart:\\u003cbr\\u003eEfficient Design: Battery-friendly and lightweight, perfect for extended play sessions.\\u003cbr\\u003eUniversal Appeal: Suitable for players of all ages, making it ideal for families and individuals alike.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Anywhere: From remote locations to everyday downtime, this app is always ready to entertain.\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Maximize Your Experience:\\u003cbr\\u003eStay Updated: Regularly check for updates to access new puzzles and features.\\u003cbr\\u003eTry Different Modes: Explore various activities to keep your experience dynamic.\\u003cbr\\u003eCompete with Friends: Share your progress and challenge friends to beat your scores.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart Playing Today:\\u003cbr\\u003eInstall \\u0026quot;100+ Offline Games No WiFi Fun\\u0026quot; and explore a world of offline puzzles and games tailored to your preferences. Perfect for every moment when you want to enjoy quality entertainment without the need for an internet connection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience gaming freedom anytime, anywhere. Get started now!\"],\"Fun Offline Games\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jQIZhxT6cZt9DVh0Ev2BUIQaQ-EJ4EjcgT3WAvy7arb-r7q19A2rW2O-_FMWpwL7_cqEVlYouujGjZuAZv14\"],null,[118,120,121,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.49 - $7.98 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.liteorange.hometopia\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DNlTlOWp5zc9Xe77eizL8vU7aT72_SwVwSHcz0NtSlMz6Dmosk8BM_PDv3h2Zd661HVX9gK2klsySgKmaGoiUJk\"],null,[145,186,242,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aWQarOpCPESeAsLj1xVfRsU7LZJh9ka-WQOCQo8CaJhfYz89nuGR1AUzHB17FnMTLw0WFf3siKhysVwPh3s6\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lxB9LgGwwx8eJCeqimCIOHSAc_W5foOIoKgZolc1TSIbs0qp8vunjXkkoPytlUC-r9xcetIu6vjmXKyJTFHYuA\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3pd4sXVRwJ5tK-wNGMWYivdgdYWbxL-9A7Sc0bQSmHEu3vis8jM0IK7RtfGrm5yxAoCdWXd8QbNkl8vAnRvM\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MDKHx1Qj5PECJUvVlqU8L6kCTeFIKPIlxNFlImTQRn2z30JacNUs_zU5sz-WDJAwX8gV_kwia5jRvKdW8NPLHA\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i5bxaH2Xfz1Vi9WuNDECSYTVIU-vPRhJ6KNH-AXzW__QEY2HCydPIZhkXsAqM_CFpnH0G8h6p_eINdp1JTbpbT4\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gndFMzlL0YOXUFXhvORbdETmiuf44XI-W6YwcrSaTWaWXnpyM2GYsmjKuDg8NEa5zctGvDHxKwIazfaw0fis\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rmuP3GK0b0mfdbK0Sit4CMqduRwSz6VUXKv3d0uXXD2mhP132Vyx7aPKBppIEKed5Q1GobU7CmgyFfeBSRHH2A\"]]],\"Frost Valley™: Merge \\u0026 Story\",[\"4.8\",4.81],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.liteorange.hometopia\"]],[\"qgJiGmAID0oTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhjb20ubGl0ZW9yYW5nZS5ob21ldG9waWEQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Frost Valley: Merge \\u0026amp; Story—a cozy place recovering from a long, chilly winter.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe frost may have slowed things down, but with a little help, warmth and color are ready to return.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge items, follow story steps, and enjoy watching each frozen corner feel alive again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlong the way, you’ll meet friends who are starting over and happy to have your help.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge to Discover\\u003cbr\\u003eTap, drag, and merge to uncover bigger, better, and more exciting items.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect merged items to advance chapters, unlock new scenes, and restore each space step by step.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRestore to Revive\\u003cbr\\u003eFix up frosty homes and make each space feel warm and welcoming again.\\u003cbr\\u003eEach repair opens new rooms and scenes, gently showing the valley coming back to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay to Reward\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin cozy in-game events with new characters, festive themes, and fun little stories.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect special rewards that add fun surprises and new moments to enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your journey today and help Frost Valley find its warmth again—one merge at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.liteorange.co/ps.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.liteorange.co/terms.html\"],\"Tuyoo Games (HK) Limited\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nxjFTKu2zkGda6GGffv2Fa_2HREVW6m3EkpHszyPQhglvZww9-g0zi4T7vj2I4dSnIzZsu__ZLomxM71bo5IxA\"],null,[196,210,216,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Mild Swearing\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/detail