icXWldc8HPyAza9fjubQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oRyONLHTJaTJhS9SHS_GmEfI8XFWeSNP9lssFHf6j1MrrtO_nj01WpfS4YDxE3iMQOImZ0HC5CtFq70cdrdD\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qBrpCU0oNqSCbL9L7-Fza7P1ynXAgJlsF3LINR8ZchgAiYWWUOJyocXpbROMD7rrEVbdRfXmyCbU1aSCJCBfMg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5C-416G1HcFvsoadbEd65XAC7_TZLVJ8erzkGQ8MpbK1guE098z-S92VF0W320JhWnpQzXPTsrNTowbWw8h1Ww\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oRyONLHTJaTJhS9SHS_GmEfI8XFWeSNP9lssFHf6j1MrrtO_nj01WpfS4YDxE3iMQOImZ0HC5CtFq70cdrdD\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qBrpCU0oNqSCbL9L7-Fza7P1ynXAgJlsF3LINR8ZchgAiYWWUOJyocXpbROMD7rrEVbdRfXmyCbU1aSCJCBfMg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5C-416G1HcFvsoadbEd65XAC7_TZLVJ8erzkGQ8MpbK1guE098z-S92VF0W320JhWnpQzXPTsrNTowbWw8h1Ww\"]]],\"Goods Sorter\",[\"4.7\",4.7090907],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gimica.goodssorter\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gimica.goodssorter\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gimica.goodssorter\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IE0oTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgocChZjb20uZ2ltaWNhLmdvb2Rzc29ydGVyEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"The shelves are full of mixed-up groceries. Can you put everything in the right place?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGoods Sorter is a colourful sorting puzzle where you move products between shelves and bring identical items together. Look carefully at each arrangement, use the available spaces wisely, and clear the goods one group at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple drag controls make each puzzle easy to begin, while more crowded shelf layouts require thoughtful decisions. Moving the wrong item can limit your options, so consider what each space will open before making your next move.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you become stuck, helpful tools can reveal a move, pause the timer, or rearrange the remaining items.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Drag and rearrange products across the shelves\\u003cbr\\u003e• Match identical goods to remove them\\u003cbr\\u003e• Solve a variety of shelf arrangements\\u003cbr\\u003e• Plan moves around the available spaces\\u003cbr\\u003e• Use hint, freeze, and shuffle tools\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy bright, grocery-themed visuals\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play at your own pace in quick or longer sessions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFind the matches, organize the shelves, and complete each sorting challenge in Goods Sorter.\"],\"Gimica GmbH\",\"10,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Obo1wXl90LCbgg6CM1bhmn6P6l2_HFKnR_ZGM-uRvvgJFA2Ys-b2ijigoVowrB_OoXOAe-10-nyAI-BKtJpwgQ\"],null,[238,234,202,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"http