P79boLfCLYmzikwCr8O8p3eERScItU89BSHOeHD_arFaozzsfQBPebBkj0lRhIKHlKuQyR1CI37kD7SvqzWo\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aZCw3ApuWr2PP7igfhxf5bBJdWwnhkD02JPxfWKHGY4KnykKWo4RGvFc-DBbbKgQgiQ1mgrEqb-mL434dSzG\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W78v33nkzAo_s_AM_LHUMjbMcN3JmcIHWrG7KxlgePXoTBpe1m-TpZjJxs35Wiay6m2IELHDTencXCaAs0Jreg0\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xEOIDLiwfDZwkuDLj86ie-Z2A1knht3Mg1UEF12AUXf32XA4CMR3wY9TyqpQ6l-hNX2uDEz3pf6s0lMv8NlQxjE\"]]],\"Water Sort: Color Match\",[\"4.7\",4.7058825],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.water.sort.puzzle.game.color.magic.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.water.sort.puzzle.game.color.magic.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.water.sort.puzzle.game.color.magic.free\"]],[\"qgJ1GnMIFkoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRwoxCitjb20ud2F0ZXIuc29ydC5wdXp6bGUuZ2FtZS5jb2xvci5tYWdpYy5mcmVlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Did you know? Playing a simple puzzle game can relax your mind and clear your head! 💙\\u003cbr\\u003eAfter a busy day, take a moment to focus on color sorting and relax. Water Sort: Color Match brings you soft water sounds, bright colors, and smooth pouring animations. It keeps your brain active while helping you feel calm.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you want to rest after work, clear your mind, or just enjoy a fun puzzle game, this colorful water sorting game is perfect for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💧 Gameplay Introduction 💧\\u003cbr\\u003eWater Sort: Color Match is super easy to learn and lots of fun!\\u003cbr\\u003eTap a bottle to pour colored water into another bottle.\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch the same colors until every bottle has only one color.\\u003cbr\\u003eThink carefully, solve fun puzzles, and enjoy winning each level.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo time limits, no pressure—play and relax at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌿 Healthy Features 🌿\\u003cbr\\u003e🧴 Thousands of fun puzzles to challenge your mind.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌊 Smooth water animations and nice pouring effects.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Calm background music and gentle sound effects.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Easy to learn, but fun to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Helpful tools, including \\u0026quot;Undo\\u0026quot; and extra bottles.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Beautiful colors and clean graphics that are easy on your eyes.\\u003cbr\\u003e📱 Play anytime, anywhere—even without internet (offline)!\\u003cbr\\u003e🆓 100% Free to download and play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Good for Your Mind and Body 🧠\\u003cbr\\u003eWater Sort: Color Match is more than just a game—it’s a great daily workout for your brain.\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Improve your focus with fun and easy sorting challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Train your brain to think and plan ahead.\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Reduce daily stress with pretty colors and relaxing gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Enjoy a quiet moment to slow down and recharge your energy.\\u003cbr\\u003e▪️ Take a healthy break with a game made for your comfort.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Why You\\u0026#39;ll Love It 🌈\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery level gives you a new chance to sort, think, and relax. Watch the colorful water flow, feel happy when you finish a puzzle, and enjoy the perfect mix of fun and calm.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay for 5 minutes during a break or unwind before bed. Water Sort: Color Match is the best way to exercise your brain and relax your mind.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Water Sort: Color Match now to relax, think, and have fun today! 💙💧\"],\"FunForge Studios\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7mGpjtVqSZr64ZQmWJY-9