l,[null,\"Solve Arrows, Save Cats 🐾\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to the coziest cat village. Pull the tangled arrows, free the trapped kittens, and watch your sleepy little town fill up with purring, head-bumping, yarn-chasing feline friends. No timers. No pressure. Just you, satisfying puzzles, and a growing family of cats.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐱 Collect Cats, One Rescue at a Time\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery puzzle you solve frees another cat to collect. Cheese Tabbies, dapper Tuxedos, elegant Russian Blues — collect cats of every personality and watch your collection settle into the village. The more you rescue, the bigger your cat collection grows. Each new cat is yours to name, play with, and add to a cozy collection that brings your cat sanctuary to life. Gotta collect them all.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Relaxing Arrow Puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003eTap the arrows in the right order to clear the vines and rescue cats stuck in a sticky situation. The arrow puzzles start gentle and grow into satisfying brain teasers — easy to pick up, deep enough to keep you thinking. A cute cat puzzle game for your logic and your soul.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 Build a village where cats love to live\\u003cbr\\u003eDecorate a cozy house with the hearts you collect from every rescue. With each piece of furniture, every fountain and slide, the once-white village comes back to life in vivid color. Playgrounds for cats to romp in, parks to stroll through, a fishing spot where fish swim by — every corner fills up with color.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExpand your village however you like: a pink cherry blossom garden, a blue seaside, a farm where carrot bunnies hop about, a campsite under a sky full of stars. Don\\u0026#39;t forget to dress up your cats with cat supplies and costumes. The more color returns, the more cats come to visit. Turn the blank white fields into your very own village, bustling with cats.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😌 A Cozy Game with No Time Limits\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is a relaxing game made for unwinding. There are no countdowns and no penalties — get stuck and you can always grab a hint. Play one puzzle on your commute or lose an hour decorating; the cat village is always here when you need a calm moment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Why You\\u0026#39;ll Love Arrows \\u0026amp; Cats\\u003cbr\\u003e- A perfect loop of puzzles and cozy simulation. Every solved puzzle helps your village grow.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Heartwarming little moments as your cats greet you, knead, and do happy dances.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Your personal cat shelter, always in your pocket.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The quiet joy of watching your feline friends multiply.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve arrows, Save cats. Build a village that\\u0026#39;s entirely your own.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Arrows \\u0026amp; Cats — the cozy cat collecting game where puzzles and purrs come together.\"],\"Nanali Studios\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SKcGirupwefoPZ4-tlqG232H81WOljTs9Eit5Oebta95Ngv46V2ACS2BcRxj_yqeFOo1PauF16ZQJFf2m2aJnb4\"],null,[246,246,245,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.Nanali.ArrowsAndCats\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.Nanali.ArrowsAndCats\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.48 - $149.98 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.rovio.baba\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XrA1acf-l1YT0jw0QTxWqpJLE_TYSgdGpWE1vrEepFpA2128Zx4to0ARPvKFdhT5vAc0LHHC7xAAwa8aABIFeg\"],null,[34,161,253,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RvQW8IkwIaUSTPMUbQO57OG164PaZCrzIyxPRAyKmPQ-YxY08lMab6DIBrk_e-l71Ljt6QjbcJKXjqzsPkG4\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_2gl3_p2eRVSZLgRsAcmSFNfwX2B_2yV7B6qXxMWvxSMWrlxqaby4dG9QvopDk1BSeDZCikBgGlt6eZ4wza54g\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O2gcRbmDaF8-xlQROIYNHkJrCz11w5bQKZNVzFy3WUZCIr1B23IQaw4r46GmYG2XManRd4RuHY6m-clzKQybuQ\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_QqjQ4anhIgIggzDCOp4C6HiS3XxRDIOn8pN9nQUQHrXgHVnLwg8V13MhnR_hEOYzlKwJxNlqvYnsunf9Iw6Pw\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hmJwh4KnL20fKoO7YWwQgMogAYlmoVOLmyl12GMSn_Njzv3ZpQ4vS9ziI5tBQZ3AnkwKHnj-ZD4S1jiLe5eF5Q\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RvQW8IkwIaUSTPMUbQO57OG164PaZCrzIyxPRAyKmPQ-YxY08lMab6DIBrk_e-l71Ljt6QjbcJKXjqzsPkG4\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_2gl3_p2eRVSZLgRsAcmSFNfwX2B_2yV7B6qXxMWvxSMWrlxqaby4dG9QvopDk1BSeDZCikBgGlt6eZ4wza54g\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O2gcRbmDaF8-xlQROIYNHkJrCz11w5bQKZNVzFy3WUZCIr1B23IQaw4r46GmYG2XManRd4RuHY6m-clzKQybuQ\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"http