yIfQA2a5qx-LuPVOK9JHFnr_LsCDbSxfWLs9gFEQS9fHC4H1QmnMWdWtFdvyjvo-fDzxps8\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zwJAMRcYg01Wei0Rm185HjdcIe3vbUl76gEW48t3eZfLjCXSODxCdiSCZzP_oY7D8iQazepwdUmb4PUuWxfVGw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nHzvDdqecenE7jDCD9BI2uM5ZbItzs27Lxw7_2XCtYHJdbqwUSbASdtGtUAOAzMDtuQrskwggFNLvRR6-R5FgQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dGEp39BRpmDWnRex3AM7y2jQNBsp6-0k0dQUzL21lsUVg2bTtVr_B8gYQ1GNhce0-fjbbm93SUAIlqbYPaJdxNk\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EnQGB1x1Lk3e7uF1bO9-PambnWOzwQbVEmzbu6m3Z5Y5TRaJiWadUG5rpbX1bkqwNeaePuESxP1KaJF_2QwGfA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pNe-Loguf_RWrSpCyIfQA2a5qx-LuPVOK9JHFnr_LsCDbSxfWLs9gFEQS9fHC4H1QmnMWdWtFdvyjvo-fDzxps8\"]]],\"Yarnscapes: Color by Number\",[\"3.8\",3.8],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yarn.scapes.color.by.number.free.games\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIIJEoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRgowCipjb20ueWFybi5zY2FwZXMuY29sb3IuYnkubnVtYmVyLmZyZWUuZ2FtZXMQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🧶 Yarnscapes: Color by Number\\u003cbr\\u003eTap once—and every connected pixel bead snaps into place, lighting up a whole section with color. ✨\\u003cbr\\u003eNo slow, block-by-block coloring.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo repetitive tapping.\\u003cbr\\u003eYarnscapes reimagines classic color by number as soft, yarn-textured pixel bead art. Choose a number, tap a matching block, and watch an entire connected area fill at once.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo need to draw or paint every tiny square by hand. Just follow the numbers and enjoy the satisfying moment when a whole patch falls perfectly into place. 🎨\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 One Tap. One Whole Area.\\u003cbr\\u003eTransform a simple numbered grid into soft, colorful pixel art.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Choose a color from the numbered palette\\u003cbr\\u003e• Find a pixel block with the matching number\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tap once to fill every connected block\\u003cbr\\u003e• Watch yarn-textured pixel beads land together\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete one color and continue with the next\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery tap creates clear progress. Instead of filling a single square, you complete an entire connected section and reveal more of the picture at once.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom the first number to the final bead, vivid colors and cozy yarn textures gradually come together in one satisfying artwork. 🧶\\u003cbr\\u003e🖼️ Explore Nine Colorful Categories\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen the coloring book and discover yarn-textured pictures across nine different themes:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cute Art 🧸 — Sweet characters and playful designs\\u003cbr\\u003e• Animals 🐾 — Adorable pets and charming creatures\\u003cbr\\u003e• Objects 🪴 — Colorful items from everyday life\\u003cbr\\u003e• Nature 🌿 — Plants, landscapes, and natural beauty\\u003cbr\\u003e• Festivals 🎉 — Festive scenes and joyful celebrations\\u003cbr\\u003e• Emoji 😊 — Playful expressions and different emotions\\u003cbr\\u003e• People 👩 — Characters, portraits, and personal styles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fantasy 🦄 — Magical creatures and imaginative scenes\\u003cbr\\u003e• Houses 🏡 — Cozy homes and colorful buildings\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom familiar objects and adorable animals to fantasy worlds and cozy houses, each category offers something different to discover.\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose a picture, follow the numbers, and turn its pixel grid into soft, colorful yarn art.\\u003cbr\\u003e📅 Relax and Color Every Day\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit the Daily page and enjoy more color by numbers challenges at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete today’s featured picture\\u003cbr\\u003e• Revisit pictures from previous dates\\u003cbr\\u003e• Build your own colorful pixel art calendar\\u003cbr\\u003e• Zoom in to complete smaller spaces\\u003cbr\\u003e• Use hints to find hidden blocks\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy coloring with no timers or pressure\\u003cbr\\u003e• Save your progress and continue anytime\\u003cbr\\u003eStart a picture, pause whenever you need, and return exactly where you left off. Every completed daily challenge adds another colorful yarn artwork to your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003eLove Jewelscapes, jewel-inspired art, casual pixel games, or relaxing adult coloring? Yarnscapes brings you a softer way to color by numbers.\\u003cbr\\u003eOne tap fills a whole area.\\u003cbr\\u003eOne completed number reveals more of the picture.\\u003cbr\\u003ePicture by picture, build a collection of soft and colorful yarn scapes. ✨\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Yarnscapes for free, tap once, and feel your first whole section fall into place. 🧶🎨\"],\"LoveColoring Game\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VuntwrvU4C9R73cfubW8_0BzZ3i29he7-ZcHK8fJBsNOgOVT6HelTMoU9a3bGQpjbk2vTvwg4h3ASAJBc1nP2g\"],null,[47,98,252,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,