y.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.red.arrows.android\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.red.arrows.android\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.red.arrows.android\"]],[\"qgJgGl4ILEoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgocChZjb20ucmVkLmFycm93cy5hbmRyb2lkEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Why Play 《Color Maze》?\\u003cbr\\u003e—Brain Training: Challenges logic, planning \\u0026amp; spatial awareness – exercise your mind with directional puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Stress-Free Fun: No timers, just thoughtful gameplay – calm strategy without pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Focused Enjoyment: Minimalist design cuts distractions, letting you dive into puzzle-solving.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Flexible Playtime: Perfect for 5-minute breaks or long challenges – fits your schedule easily.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Achievement Drive: Finish all tasks without losing a heart – boost satisfaction per level.\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Highlights: Strategy \\u0026amp; tranquility that keeps you engaged.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Thousands of handcrafted levels – no repetitive auto-generated puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Progressive Difficulty: Starts gentle, ramps up to test planning – never too easy or overwhelming.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Minimalist Aesthetic: Clean design prioritizes puzzles – focus on solving, not navigating.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Calm Experience: No rush, no time limits – take as long as needed to plan the order.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Anytime Play: Quick or extended sessions – ideal for free moments.\\u003cbr\\u003eGameplay: Simple Actions, Smart Strategies\\u003cbr\\u003e—Core Goal: Launch all pointers collision-free – plan order to avoid blocks.\\u003cbr\\u003e—Easy Controls: Tap to select and release – intuitive, focus on strategy. \\u003cbr\\u003e—Strategic Thinking: Which one first? Which blocks others? Every choice shapes success!\\u003cbr\\u003e—Challenge Target: Complete levels heart-intact – test precision \\u0026amp; forward planning.\\u003cbr\\u003ePractical Feature: Help When You Need It\\u003cbr\\u003e—Hint System: Stuck? Use hints for subtle guidance – progress without spoiling fun.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload 《Color Maze》 now – your go-to for calm, strategic puzzle fun!\\u003cbr\\u003eUse logic to map paths, conquer thousands of handcrafted levels, and finish all tasks heart-intact!\"],\"Beijing Youyoutang Technology Co.,ltd.\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cHN0CUxbup39VpH7H47hKSDW73PjiwhbZPE4pqunp7iDhQ_eNTwWF6I_85cPlZNpBZXVnY5sO4nARliHd3Bt\"],null,[4,5,7,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.red.arrows.android\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.red.arrows.android\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,nu