60Qtr64GhSs8FYWZiIcStEyZyUoy6WXqqpMNduI1yKWrpP4ZUJRQx2IHlllCuYIBxB3FMScv_NnaIEU2w\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-Skb0sViYX4AMEY33kSdK2nRw2vAaSAtaYQRm1FT8uFPwOV9Ks4ZOGPpi-xSjeR1llbFJSCmne-PTkFeRhuZ\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FsB39z4ryEPZRT7GagZ-WFQz0I0vfC-hiLrkvuDFpKxNCQSBPeFV8F6xNIZdIL-IP1vdeUy8uItH5JnOi2Ala8o\"]]],\"My Talking Angela 2\",[\"4.5\",4.530488],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangela2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangela2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangela2\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIL0oTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAoiChxjb20ub3V0Zml0Ny5teXRhbGtpbmdhbmdlbGEyEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"My Talking Angela 2 is the ultimate virtual pet game that brings fun, fashion, and creativity to your everyday life. Step into the big city with the stylish Angela and embark on a journey filled with exciting activities and endless entertainment in the Talking Tom \\u0026amp; Friends universe!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stylish Hair, Makeup, and Fashion Choices: Transform Angela with various hairstyles, makeup options, and fashionable outfits. Dress her up for fashion shows and personalize her look to make her shine like a star.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Exciting Activities: Engage in a variety of fun activities, including dancing, baking, martial arts, trampoline jumping, jewelry making, and planting flowers on the balcony.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Delicious Food and Snacks: Bake and cook delicious treats for Angela. From cakes to cookies, satisfy her sweet tooth with your culinary skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Travel Adventures: Take Angela on jet-setting travel adventures to explore new destinations and cultures. And to shop until she drops!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini-Games and Puzzles: Challenge your skills with fun mini-games and puzzles that test your reflexes and strategic thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Sticker Collections: Collect and complete sticker albums to unlock special rewards and new content. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExpress Your Creativity: Angela inspires you to be creative, bold, and expressive. Design her outfits, experiment with makeup, and decorate her home to reflect your unique style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Outfit7, creators of the hit games My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Tom Friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Subscriptions, which are auto-renewable, unless cancelled before the end of the current subscription period. You can manage and cancel a subscription in your Google Play Account settings after purchase.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Some features may be subject to different pricing and availability.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"500,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uRSAhuxCcQyMRnbbYAUyApTUKAw-E793Nt65rhsxxykaK2xMMTSlK0ta4umPik-8RDqojHmZmh97G0hU1OBTUQ\"],null,[149,99,180,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangela2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangela2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.48 - $149.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.tiny.medical.idle\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EfZ5m9ja8IqxJKo4tywnRcpunJOThObvDjB9keq4MMfdc6PEuuVW3b6fBY3gI0i9T0U8Ub2Ure75wZfXJpRzDf0\"],null,[13,158,249,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Jh4BFJAknbsgcQWeCJrp-D8DYlgIuz5kfaFABZepdGurauaFYv3dPG5tUBvrlndO_kIkgi4ohstOdBBKN4hxGQ\"]],[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/D7U5ZScns9Qsbx-3IYcW9_xjAxJUeqRqgSHV2a6zuOD1rmJCV7_9Ndlx61V89O910UjMQt_-IqhuFPJtpnTy\"]],[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LqX2xMuQUQVSonOstoYcLBf2vhsyOJRIHTLHmiKTFpGaMNOa97XiuVYt1KheKe4ASXpbISJFEaA9UajgJNjT1A\"]],[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q1Yz_Tz2ixaG5jcIyQDPSIPJe5xeC4RwjH807Paf8VVcHxUizmjzvGThF4wYpQklX6rCu9CNrUGPJj0-KTj0\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cHisgzOYD5cmol4iVMblbEUcdm29OVfV8Kjxh5AepiErv_TnNmLsNKDJK2fm9Yn6yw-dCtOdZ007eDhOdfZRcUc\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dyaDd9o8-fhQvZk_BgxpPAAEFmS5B3AVeAwsGZ2TPKvO8chRV-jU85DjcNgpksNUw1UsHp4DPA0CnY25QkJosxE\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/H54u69Fc3r1OoObaB84pFLkgfnwyN92i3lIorUwshlIMttCreZnx5F728ds1YgE-CVlI7t4C5-ZTwl7UreO6\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KxSd3MA70ZdMmGjislfZsA20EIcAbAnDAtmHZIqbeiY45hCpI1K1nsD5l_tTKX__3wYaTGeDVyeJUdMJX3x-QQ\"]]],\"Tiny Medical Idle\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\"]],[\"qgJZGlcIMEoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCKwobChVjb20udGlueS5tZWRpY2FsLmlkbGUQARgDEgwKBAgBEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Tiny Medical Idle is a relaxing, stress-relieving idle casual hospital simulation game. Step into the role of a hospital director, build your very own miniature medical paradise from scratch, and enjoy the simple, comforting fun of hospital management.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game features five independent medical production lines: Outpatient Clinic, CT Room, Operating Room, Pharmacy, and Ward. These five lines run separately, generating resources and gold coins respectively with no mandatory workflow connections. The Outpatient Clinic receives incoming patients and provides steady basic income, serving as the core for early capital accumulation. The CT Room operates with professional medical equipment to deliver higher single-session returns. The Operating Room boasts high earnings and is the key line for amassing large amounts of gold coins. The Pharmacy runs non-stop, consistently bringing in considerable revenue. The Ward generates a steady stream of income to support the steady expansion of your hospital. Each line fulfills its own function. You are free to choose your priority development direction, with full control over your gameplay pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse the gold coins earned from operations to upgrade and strengthen the five production lines. Upgrades improve processing efficiency, raise the maximum single-session yield, and speed up overall operation. When a production line reaches specific levels, brand-new workstations and a wealth of exquisite themed decorations will be unlocked. Upgrading the Outpatient Clinic unlocks more consultation workstations, along with decorative items such as modern desks, chairs and medical record cabinets. Upgrading the CT Room unlocks brand-new scanning equipment paired with sleek, tech-inspired medical ornaments. Upgrading the Operating Room opens more surgical workstations and unlocks sterile-style scene decorations. Upgrading the Pharmacy expands dispensing workstations and unlocks a wide array of medicine shelves and display props. Upgrading the Ward unlocks more hospital beds, as well as soft furnishings including curtains, nightstands and green plants. All decorations can be freely used to spruce up your hospital, and some also provide extra stat bonuses, boosting both your hospital’s appearance and profit-making ability at the same time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game focuses on a laid-back idle experience, with no brain-taxing complex strategic puzzles or stressful time-limited missions, making it perfect for playing in short, fragmented sessions. While the game is running, all production lines operate automatically and gold coins keep accumulating. All you need to do is continuously reinvest your earnings into upgrading and expanding your hospital.\"],\"Solid Games\",\"1,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OupKy1Rq1AK6HYH8cOroSZuWab53AkSJQKAKynY-x-DFlpxd4FcOn0sS_la0fc81M1-wgDT3731FNKi5wK3a\"],null,[153,154,158,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tiny.medical.idle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.48 - $38.98 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"