u003eEscape the everyday and step into a world of pure horticultural bliss. In Gardenship, you’ll inherit exclusive royal lands, cultivate breathtaking blooms, and unearth secrets that have been buried for generations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNurture Your Dream Garden\\u003cbr\\u003eCultivate over 100 unique flower species. From classic crimson roses and cheerful daisies to rare, exotic blooms, discover their secrets and watch your royal estate burst into life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock Royal Story Chapters\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery flower you grow brings you closer to the truth. Experience hundreds of minutes of immersive drama and romance with absolutely no limits. Unlock thrilling story chapters and uncover mysterious secrets hidden deep within the palace walls without spending a dime.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDesign \\u0026amp; Decorate\\u003cbr\\u003eMake the manor truly yours. Choose from gorgeous themes and stunning decorations to style your estate exactly the way you want.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Art of Floristry\\u003cbr\\u003eWeave your freshly picked flowers into breathtaking bouquets. Select the perfect vases, create stunning arrangements, and sell your floral masterpieces for a true sense of achievement.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with Friends\\u003cbr\\u003eSocializing has never been this blooming fun! Visit your friends’ gardens to admire their designs, help them out, or playfully pick a few flowers. Compete to see who can gather the most to win rich, exclusive rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnwind, create, and connect. Download Gardenship now and start your royal gardening journey.\"],\"ONEMT SGP\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0i35EnJAD8CQsVKGw_1tuCReYbbM2EEq24Uk01lwmoXXHc474Z439GJQUUy32Q5ksokPP53nQ0qqzCuixxyBcA\"],null,[208,193,234,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercon