6nJm4\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gbWReZhO5KONnVkdYY9o05QlojiklWRU__WpjIMqIKd8GlXNPXDHsOm1yCHRGO2XJFviWYL4M9uLGCTIcLpEALA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L9tdT7oxit1dSB9ZYPKfqVONQwU45lJ-SksLlLUZQazqfU-puqIjEGnF3NgmVpjuiO1LvrLU9CxJNy1gFV2YnQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OKpN5Hrmf79xJxU6JJuhHDarW_BGGJ_2KH10waaQZOwmtSzF50v_PSYWWDaRRRTXJ3ov371Q52kpWLSdqXFQJIo\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y8E7TzxnX11f7HLXD60kxBVjtzRks1MUuJ4nsAe0FHbwh7T4k2po06-d5YlXgghvMku7cAzhrvBMSkFiBW7rb7U\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e7yKeOyRnqNAB940XkQZdqgmP3cGRvZv3GGih1367Cp-RriGo6TUMXlrJH-JR9l_eBvuusUmvuYRz3Ti8-6nJm4\"]]],\"Mahjong Flow\",[\"5.0\",5],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmahjong.flow.tile.slide.match\\u0026rdid\\u003dmahjong.flow.tile.slide.match\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmahjong.flow.tile.slide.match\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IN0oTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBFwoVCKqOoILbq5eKQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI5CiMKHW1haGpvbmcuZmxvdy50aWxlLnNsaWRlLm1hdGNoEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Mahjong Flow: Slide \\u0026amp; Match is a relaxing sliding tile puzzle where every move brings the board to life. Match identical mahjong tiles, enjoy satisfying collisions, and discover clever routes through each layout. With large, readable tiles and simple controls, it offers adults, seniors, and casual puzzle fans an inviting mix of calm play and thoughtful challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003eFind two identical mahjong tiles on the board.\\u003cbr\\u003eTap matching tiles that are already aligned, or slide a tile horizontally or vertically to line it up with its match.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen the matching tiles are in the same row or column with an unobstructed path between them, they connect and disappear.\\u003cbr\\u003eRemove every tile from the board to complete the level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ WHAT MAKES MAHJONG FLOW DIFFERENT?\\u003cbr\\u003e🀄 Slide, Align, and Match\\u003cbr\\u003ePairs do not always begin next to each other. Shift tiles across open spaces, create a direct route, and bring matching symbols into position. How you move one tile can reshape the choices that follow.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌊 Smooth, Satisfying Tile Flow\\u003cbr\\u003eTiles glide into place, matching pairs collide, and routes appear as the layout changes. A good sequence of moves gives every puzzle its own natural rhythm.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Spatial Thinking Made Enjoyable\\u003cbr\\u003eLook beyond the first available pair. Choosing which tile to move can open one route while closing another, turning simple matching into an enjoyable exercise in spatial reasoning and logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👀 Easy-to-Read Tiles and Comfortable Design\\u003cbr\\u003eBold symbols, generous tile sizes, and an organized board make important details easy to recognize. The interface stays out of the way, so you can concentrate on each move.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 A Nudge for Tricky Moments\\u003cbr\\u003eHint can point out an option when you miss a route, while Shuffle changes the arrangement when you want a fresh view of the board.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📶 Offline Casual Play\\u003cbr\\u003eNo Wi-Fi is required for regular puzzle play. Continue a board during a commute, between appointments, or whenever you have a few minutes to yourself.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👴 EASY TO SETTLE INTO\\u003cbr\\u003eLarge mahjong tiles, bold symbols, and direct sliding controls keep the screen comfortable to follow. The rules are approachable for adults and seniors, while route-based decisions provide enough depth for experienced puzzle players.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mahjong Flow: Slide \\u0026amp; Match and set the tiles in motion!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNote: Mahjong Flow: Slide \\u0026amp; Match is a casual tile-matching puzzle that uses mahjong-inspired symbols. Its slide-and-match rules are separate from traditional multiplayer mahjong gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💌Contact us:\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer Service Contact Tel: +447594816412\\u003cbr\\u003eEmail: passionfruit.customerservice@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/passion-fruit-joy-pp/home\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/eulaofpassionfruitjoy/home\"],\"Passion Fruit Joy\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bEG9lI7yOph46qKr553ivljDMmEjR0JadxRzalq98Zh5c83nzPUTkASllTMXVrnzS-9TR386B6sLiSKAoR55Hg\"],null,[25,96,121,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmahjong.flow.tile.slide.match\\u0026rdid\\u003dmahjong.flow.tile.slide.match\\u0026fea