1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1J66iHB6FAQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003e✨Tile Match: Rescue Story — Your Match Shapes the Story!✨\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a world where every tile holds a piece of a story waiting for your touch. In \\u003cb\\u003eTile Match: Rescue Story\\u003c/b\\u003e, become the hero of an emotional journey—solve relaxing yet challenging match 3 puzzles to change fates, restore broken dreams, and bring light back to a world that needs you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you progress, you will assist characters in risk by earning special items through your puzzle skills. Decorate and rebuild meaningful locations, uncover hidden memories, and open new chapters in a deeply touching tale. Each level brings you closer to turning sadness into hope.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 How Your Matching Makes a Difference:\\u003cbr\\u003e•Match tiles to pass levels and help characters rebuild their lives\\u003cbr\\u003e•Overcome challenging levels to unlock heartwarming story moments\\u003cbr\\u003e•Use boosters like Shuffle and Hint when you get stuck\\u003cbr\\u003e•Bring beautiful locations back to life through the power of puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Why Players Love Tile Match: Rescue Story:\\u003cbr\\u003e•❤️ Experience an emotional narrative where your matching truly matters\\u003cbr\\u003e•🧩 Thousands of levels that blend fun, strategy, and storytelling\\u003cbr\\u003e•🎁 Daily bonus and regular events that offer exclusive rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e•🌟 Perfect mix of relaxation, challenge, and emotional depth\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBe the Hope they need!\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload \\u003cb\\u003eTile Match: Rescue Story\\u003c/b\\u003e now and start a puzzle adventure where every match brings a new beginning!\"],\"Wood Puzzle Sudoku Games\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/R0f08PQp6zxC