920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VrHSNvoeuRzeerEQzVT2kxHHKqWChzLIRgwTliK9W9J_IMkFlZFiw9IVyH9KXGeSQ2udtVIw5WLvD8XR9JkYVw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HP-ZRKFtqASQLvH5BEBB17ZJ1w6TwVbD7g_nJ6LXNFwmZBEimOa7cB-R35uMl5F-AZNiIM2M-BSotYwxLKwJ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2d23VK7aAnlBwBBIygHAoKbO60DzuBD450dJ8gLOD7T7xz2tkBSdz8hwSB5uL_kSD3lxNuQ9msdcDDmX4AmI\"]]],\"Mahjong Breeze\",[\"4.6\",4.625],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmahjong.breeze.tile.match.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dmahjong.breeze.tile.match.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmahjong.breeze.tile.match.game\"]],[\"qgJwGm4IP0oTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBFwoVCPD7kZuNgeeMQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI6CiQKHm1haGpvbmcuYnJlZXplLnRpbGUubWF0Y2guZ2FtZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Mahjong Breeze - Tile Match is a relaxing mahjong puzzle game where classic tile matching meets a gentle breeze of calm. Match identical mahjong tiles, complete peaceful boards, and enjoy a quiet moment of focus at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith large tiles, bright visuals, helpful tools, and endless levels, this mahjong solitaire game is easy to start and soothing to replay. Designed for adults and seniors, it brings brain training, offline play, and stress-free puzzle fun together in a calm, Zen-inspired experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003eMatch two identical selectable mahjong tiles to remove the pair. A tile can be selected when it is not covered and has at least one open side, so plan your moves and remove every tile at a relaxing pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ WHY PLAY Mahjong Breeze - Tile Match?\\u003cbr\\u003e- 🀄 Classic Mahjong Solitaire Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy timeless mahjong matching rules in a simple puzzle format. Match tiles, finish boards, and solve each layout with calm focus.\\u003cbr\\u003e- 🍃 Relaxing Puzzle Games for Adults\\u003cbr\\u003eA calm experience built for players who prefer thoughtful gameplay instead of fast action. No timer pressure, no stressful competition, just satisfying tile matching.\\u003cbr\\u003e- 👀 Large Tiles and Bright Visuals\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy-to-read mahjong tiles, simple icons, and an uncluttered board layout help make every match comfortable to see and tap.\\u003cbr\\u003e- 🧠 Brain Training and Logic Practice\\u003cbr\\u003eEach puzzle encourages memory, focus, planning, and pattern recognition. It is a gentle way to keep your mind active through daily puzzle play.\\u003cbr\\u003e- 🧩 Endless Levels\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore many tile layouts with different shapes and difficulty levels. Start with simple boards, then progress to more layered and strategic puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- 💡 Helpful Tools\\u003cbr\\u003eUse hints and shuffle when a layout becomes tricky. These tools help you keep moving while still enjoying the challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e- 📶 Offline Mahjong Puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay anytime, anywhere, with no WiFi needed. Enjoy mahjong tile matching at home, while traveling, or during quiet moments in your day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👴 A COMFORTABLE GAME FOR SENIORS AND ADULTS\\u003cbr\\u003eMahjong Breeze - Tile Match is easy to learn and pleasant to replay. Large tiles, simple controls, and a peaceful pace make it suitable for seniors, adults, and anyone who enjoys relaxing puzzle games.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you like mahjong solitaire, tile match games, matching puzzles, logic games, brain training, or classic tile-removal puzzles, Mahjong Breeze - Tile Match is made for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mahjong Breeze - Tile Match today and enjoy a calm, classic mahjong puzzle experience wherever you are!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNote: Mahjong Breeze - Tile Match is a mahjong solitaire style puzzle game. It uses mahjong-inspired tiles for matching gameplay and does not include traditional multiplayer mahjong rules.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💌Contact us:\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer Service Contact Tel: +447594816412\\u003cbr\\u003eEmail: passionfruit.customerservice@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/passion-fruit-joy-pp/home\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/eulaofpassionfruitjoy/home\"],\"Passion Fruit Joy\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PkZqo6quexkHs2vOFrD6tOmSBPvV5WAsVmM0EXoV6X3LtlimIP6MO0NLSqwBzSpdrFRH-u7t9wzzEHH1x3ekdQ\"],null,[9,126,99,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dmahjong.breeze.tile.match.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dmahjong.breeze.tile.match.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,nu