CIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOQojCh1jb20udmlzaW9uc3R1ZGlvLnRpbGV2YWNhdGlvbhABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"gltjOuAAfIk\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:gltjOuAAfIk?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:gltjOuAAfIk\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmJ6jJfXCP3_Jqa-OaZc3Bypi1qVR-b991_K25Xhi9kVGAInh1uEEOVt1ytQocJE3LojhA5ei8_Afp2BhX4MxdqEtg2QKaEbUKZ8SqAuGvH2EWdQUojq1COnIQeElcRhKoesZG9MAO5erSk3WzlPsDY9Be0V0LggobPB8ng2KAc2RydV_9yy622HAs3-1eLq-SV-zN720tJF7vG5TQo8Hedb_neHSddu4SrpEvm6yoDShAeM-QbsyTGLslOuNjW__y3Nk8yjSahYWRa0V50B8NajchaizrjhCMxV3BW901ClA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gltjOuAAfIk/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Take a break and begin a colorful vacation filled with satisfying tile play. In Tile Vacation, every tile brings a surprise, every match creates progress, and every puzzle opens a new stop. Tap the tiles, match three identical pieces, clear the board, and enjoy a calm puzzle vacation anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 A RELAXING TILE PUZZLE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTap a tile to move it into the tray, match three tiles of the same kind, and watch them disappear. Keep space for the next tile, avoid a crowded block, and clear the board before the tray fills. Each puzzle is easy to learn, but every match rewards smart choices.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay a quick tile level during a break, enjoy a longer puzzle session at home, or make any quiet moment a mini vacation. Smooth tap controls help you focus on the tiles, plan the next match, and free your mind.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏝️ TRAVEL THROUGH MANY VACATION THEMES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome a cheerful explorer and travel through beaches, islands, gardens, cafés, mountains, resorts, and cozy holiday towns. Every vacation area introduces fresh tiles, new tiles, and a different puzzle atmosphere. One tile may show fruit, another tile may feature a souvenir, and the next tiles may bring a seaside match.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClear the board to continue your vacation, unlock more tile scenes, and discover new tiles. Whether you are an experienced explorer or a new puzzle fan, every match moves you toward the next vacation stop.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 MATCH, CLEAR, AND SURVIVE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSome levels feel calm, while others ask you to survive a crowded tray and a difficult block of layered tiles. Look carefully, tap the best tile, create a useful match, and clear the board with room to spare.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA smart match can uncover hidden tiles. A careful tap can stop one block from closing your path. A strong tile strategy can help you survive the final moves and finish the puzzle. Match the tiles, manage the tray, and clear the board.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 MANY TILE TYPES AND RICH REWARDS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy tile designs inspired by food, animals, flowers, travel items, summer fun, and vacation memories. New tiles keep each puzzle fresh, while every match brings a satisfying clear effect. Complete tile levels, collect rich rewards, and continue your vacation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFinish a match, clear the board, open rewards, and enjoy steady progress. Free your focus, free your imagination, and make every tile session relaxing. Enjoy a free moment of calm without pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 YOUR COZY TILE CLUB\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTile Vacation brings the friendly feeling of a casual puzzle club with simple rules. Play at home, relax on the road, or enjoy a short vacation break. Every explorer can find a comfortable pace, from a simple tile match to a thoughtful puzzle challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the tile club mood, tap through colorful tiles, and enjoy a clean match. At home or away, the next puzzle is ready. Clear the board, collect rewards, and let each vacation scene feel like a page in your travel club.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ WHY YOU’LL LOVE TILE VACATION\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Classic tile play: tap, match three tiles, and clear the board.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing puzzle time: enjoy a calm vacation feeling at home or anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Many tile styles: discover colorful tiles across each vacation destination.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple controls: one tap selects a tile and every match feels smooth.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Smart challenge: survive a crowded block and finish the puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Explorer journey: unlock new vacation scenes along the next tile route.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Rich rewards: clear the board, complete a match, and collect prizes.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy to start: free your mind with a tile puzzle for relaxing play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 START YOUR TILE VACATION\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome the next tile explorer. Tap a tile, match three tiles, clear the board, and move toward another vacation destination. Build a relaxing routine at home, survive every clever block, and enjoy the cozy club feeling.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBegin a bright match adventure. Discover more tile art, collect more tiles, complete every puzzle, and turn each match into a peaceful vacation moment. Tap, match, clear the board, and let the next tile journey begin.\"],\"VisionStudio(HK)\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Rj6cKgNaX_6voWpsWiFWAD_a09_oKcUvGqADMio8AvDj-g8mV0qTbswO3OX4lmcXjAc9sSxZdF7nT455cYd2Gw\"],null,[241,240,240,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.visionstudio.tilevacation\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.visionstudio.tilevacation\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.48 - $40.98 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.fruitwins\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/czVkJEHGPgM6Gg8C7u4WXDIrVLFopz295_rPXUwjsV0Db_VY5JELzl7TZQFOtmTIgxzhLKDRSq7ISk_9xGwiNA\"],null,[254,234,211,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iSFk9XdoVCTG8HW4AycES1J9INK1tDGg2PV3wGQfBWiwgMRHfQ7uu-0iAdm1GHPHgM7csGF5xyEWg77VS3tGPw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iHZKQX4f1jCdBKhYzX7NtBqrKIygHUkXOZ_Y0FYS_-hR3OPqzAfbmAgtoxjbdQzgV6670E2VKL5wiwngSw4zig\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d2oq2TtN-7IkTIPlElZZcfXZUYcpWNvLLIQdmDl9Al3FGccuWiswzmICg4A7q9WynY95BNnSo7GGtRFf7CR2fg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IUO7E5ZMgRnUG5V06udm1EaCOzBQV-iwXWr3CNfrgHZa4z5JUtoNDxbMey6uGApOfcYLbVU7MvYDWzNhiPToGDc\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m9JA99ACihEknkcGY4GDyzqbF3wofFDIalYXShZR9J1j298UzA08M4ddvyQ1mjSVQnucpnlpSKCMJSbHYQr-OA\"]]],\"Fruit Wins\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fruitwins\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fruitwins\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fruitwins\"]],[\"qgJRGk8IRUoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCIwoTCg1jb20uZnJ1aXR3aW5zEAEYAxIMCgQIARABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Fruit Wins! Begin Your Ultimate Blast-and-Win Adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this lighthearted and enjoyable puzzle-shooting game, you can immerse yourself in a vibrant and juicy fruit paradise. Each shot delivers a satisfying matching experience. Whether you want to unwind during a short break or fully immerse yourself in some leisurely fun, this game offers fresh and exciting challenges for you to enjoy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple Controls, Smooth Matching\\u003cbr\\u003eJust tap to select your cannon and watch it auto-fire! Hit fruits to trigger chain reactions, quickly clear the screen, and become a master fruit matcher!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Quick Levels, Play Anytime\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level takes only a few minutes to complete. Whether it\\u0026#39;s after a meal, during your commute, or any time you need a moment to relax, you can dive into a refreshing and exhilarating matching feast anytime!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Daily Challenges, Endless Surprises\\u003cbr\\u003eComplete daily missions, collect generous rewards, and continuously unlock new content. The more you play, the more surprises you’ll discover!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Ready for the hottest casual shooter of 2026? Download Fruit Wins now—load your cannon, blast the fruit, and conquer the fruity kingdom!\"],\"Buddyplay  Limited\",\"500+\",null,