-lh.googleusercontent.com/qQnY9cPitVTDgfiPa9yttVoOjl0kwK1q91b0cPomsnCRP5QYv-2kYd9uLJa8XmPJQ6oZZf4QkM-hZGpDcABhIA\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iq-jK1-DXOtLUk6uZ9d-CeUPZOxzrVU1BRO0Sso605ME4n3OQEMqu_c3l_SKfci0IQWXU3BmtzYPSxTnwDCksw\"]]],\"Mini Games: Calm \\u0026 Relax\",[\"4.7\",4.73],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.uc.minigame.relax\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.uc.minigame.relax\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.uc.minigame.relax\"]],[\"qgJnGmUITEoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBFwoVCLzx1JnFoNuJQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIxChsKFWNvbS51Yy5taW5pZ2FtZS5yZWxheBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Mini Games: Brainrot Challenge!!        \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed to unwind after a long day? Step into a world of ultimate challenge with  full of surreal Italian Brainrot games and many more!!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Mini Games: Brainrot Challenge - where challenging meets fun and relaxation, where trending brainrot games and filters on social media meet cute design gameplay!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTired after a long day at work and school? This game is designed for all ages and classic-game enthusiasts and puzzle lovers. And the best part? It includes all the trendy filters and popular Italian Brainrot meme characters you are looking for! Get ready to tap, swipe, scream and laugh your mouth off in funny challenges – It\\u0026#39;s full of silly games, crazy sounds, brainrot challenges that make your brain go wild !! This is not just a normal game… this is a all-in-one brainrot games and filters app at its finest!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you like Scream Chicken? Our game includes all the games inspired by the most famous filters on social media such as Scream Chicken Challenge, Animal Sound Challenge, Do Re Mi challenge and many more!! These games are perfect for relaxing and chill moments. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you like Italian Brainrot memes? Are you the player who seek challenges in the chaos mini games that are inspired by the most famous Italian meme trend? We have all the mini games like Brainrot Fusion, Merge Brainrot, Ranking Brainrot Meme and many more just to satisfy your need!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stress Relief: Designed to help you unwind and reduce anxiety after a long day.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Endless Fun: A variety of mini-games to keep you entertained for hours. Inspired by most popular games and filters on social media. From trending filters, brainrot meme games, puzzle games, tap it games, we have them all!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to Play: Simple controls for a relaxing gaming experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Visually Appealing: Immerse yourself in colorful and soothing 2D graphics.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re taking a short break, commuting, or simply looking to relax, \\u0026quot;Mini Games: Brainrot Challenge\\u0026quot; offers a perfect escape. It\\u0026#39;s the perfect app to challenge yourself, pass the time, and have loads of fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWho knew having fun could be this easy and convenient? Jump in \\u0026quot;Mini Games: Brainrot Challenge\\u0026quot; and start playing today!\"],\"Unicorn Studio Official\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KkieOJILtPOLUAidT-tGpjo9HYjLJh4GMeFpQqVbM472gKEmUdln9txHBj91wHCvTsZaoQOKHTT1a9AxPokHnQ\"],null,[63,216,254,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases