lock Bus!\",[\"4.8\",4.75],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gl.bus\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gl.bus\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gl.bus\"]],[\"qgJUGlIITkoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCJgoQCgpjb20uZ2wuYnVzEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"**Block Bus! – Relax, Match \\u0026amp; Clear**\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHop aboard **Block Bus!**, a fun and relaxing block puzzle game that puts a fresh spin on the classic gameplay you know and love. Place blocks, complete lines, clear the board, and chase your highest score!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re taking a quick break or settling in for a longer puzzle session, **Block Bus!** is easy to pick up, satisfying to master, and ready to play whenever you are.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e### How to Play\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* Drag and drop blocks onto the board.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Complete full horizontal or vertical lines to clear them.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Plan each move carefully to keep enough space for new blocks.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Blocks cannot be rotated, so every placement matters.\\u003cbr\\u003e* No timer, no pressure — play at your own pace!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e### Why You’ll Love Block Bus!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚌 **Classic Puzzle Fun with a Fresh Feel**\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple rules, clever strategy, and endlessly satisfying line clears.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 **Train Your Brain**\\u003cbr\\u003eThink ahead, improve your planning skills, and challenge yourself to beat your best score.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 **Easy to Play, Hard to Master**\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for beginners, casual players, and experienced puzzle fans.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📱 **Play Anytime, Anywhere**\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy Block Bus! during short breaks, commutes, travel, or relaxing evenings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌐 **Offline Gameplay**\\u003cbr\\u003eNo WiFi? No problem. Keep playing wherever the road takes you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⏱️ **No Time Limits**\\u003cbr\\u003eTake your time and find the perfect move without any pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e### Game Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Smooth and responsive controls\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Relaxing and satisfying block gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Endless puzzle challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Clean and colorful design\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Offline play supported\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Lightweight and easy to enjoy\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Great for quick sessions or longer play\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Fun for players of all ages\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e### How Far Can You Go?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery move counts in **Block Bus!**. Keep the board clear, build your score, and see how long you can keep the journey going.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to put your puzzle skills to the test?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e**Jump into Block Bus! and start clearing blocks today!**\"],\"Loyalty Gaming\",\"10,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/obaSTna8FUJqmrBs0lmpbsaYowtgWcTH62MeWnhbADplAfgDTqKjQr3UJhYkUV4E2bfTKl1jNclCxPTh2M1T1Q\"],null,[246,242,133,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaq