/play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XemQnqkzeD8q-L948dodwKYZWqnYuLA95bbQyHUWry49A4CwnhVc0owMtk3xjjj7qvMYBP1GNpMgC_vb1rB3Lw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bbNT4gEN9vOFaPapguhIrINVuXDbOPgadZDX3qXAtcvyq5YRiNuKiQX9LZVlAID1dkVNYaZI1J8W3RlIRUerBA\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KbcqXCUL6j7UE9UNon81BXLcmtn3J1zMYb5INeTiMYmy21sW_ERQGy5d9345FZyzBCFQUjxia8wJBlNh_rtR3g\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i871RPNsLWBWZvQ2uIMeLlTKBh-eRkx1GHN1Pntc4JbhesQhDg-LlapdOxjaNPvTxRwCvNS8r1XjwakVEhQ4Og\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1Zer-HRmJHDL8VQAUknc55ZQj9IFhqk7tjP-YFVuaXUdmbKZnjqvHg5aMudkRZ-BMfGj9t7abS83ymBm0KSEt_I\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2vY4eDr2c38LgJtYzWUc9H-C50k57xaUVXslLoajIVXfu5TM14hxbf0j4JAPtP5VvBMOW0LrsWObp6X-p39SeA\"]]],\"Sand Fill: Block Puzzle\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puzzle.sand.fill.aos\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.puzzle.sand.fill.aos\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puzzle.sand.fill.aos\"]],[\"qgJcGloIT0oTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLgoeChhjb20ucHV6emxlLnNhbmQuZmlsbC5hb3MQARgDEgwKBAgBEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🖼️ A picture made of colored sand is on the wall. Time to take it apart.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA block puzzle where color and shape both matter.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Pick a block, place it on the grid below the picture, and sand of the same color pours into it.\\u003cbr\\u003e💯 When a block hits 100%, it disappears and the space opens up again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔲 The right color is not enough — the shape has to fit.\\u003cbr\\u003eLook at the open cells, count what is left, and save room for the block you will need next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ When the last grain is gone, the picture disappears and a new one goes up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, but you keep going. Pick, place, repeat.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ HIGHLIGHTS\\u003cbr\\u003e👆 One-tap controls — pick, place, done.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Color matching — each block only absorbs its own color.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔲 Space management — the color can match and the shape still won\\u0026#39;t fit.\\u003cbr\\u003e💯 Fill meter — see how full every block is at a glance.\\u003cbr\\u003e🖼️ Sand pictures — a new one on the wall every stage.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧰 Items — stuck? Hammer, magnet, vacuum.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Made for people who like block puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe picture is up. So, where does this one go?\"],\"Stormborn Inc.\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WJ6zlxh6QzFKdhufynQFkgEbgo_0yoOfMaj1lXtDfToGdHzr-eMpvP0cGZvLP1yNHbKTVhj8OGA3Ihfs7kG3\"],null,[103,201,253,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dco