ng mini-games and crazy challenges, featuring minimalist visuals and distinct collections of tricky challenging levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the viral challenges packed with mini-puzzles and tricky challenges that will test your reflexes and creativity.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCalm and de-stress with a world of satisfying stress relief games!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Features of Tricky Relax Mini Games:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Variety of trending mini-games and viral challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Engaging gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Minimalist visuals and distinct levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The best source of entertainment and stress reliever.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Endless fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready to test your skills, think on your feet, and enjoy endless fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWill you be the ultimate challenge champion?\"],\"stick hunter\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/E4ajutAncro7oSFTHcybQtFruLEGlCSC_wCKf6wVVxTkKaQOAkexP5CVXISS-mRwZsyIxuSlMlnZoQTqWywflA\"],null,[241,247,248,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sh.tricky.relax.ticktock.mini.challenges.puzzle.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sh.tricky.relax.t