gic sort enjoyment!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Key Features\\u003cbr\\u003e• Endless levels: Hundreds of unique ball sort puzzles to sharpen your mind.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play your way: No time limits or move restrictions—enjoy relaxing magic sort at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Helpful tools: Undo, add tubes, or restart a level whenever you need.\\u003cbr\\u003e• 100% offline: Enjoy magic sort puzzles anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Why You\\u0026#39;ll Love This Magic Sort Game\\u003cbr\\u003e• Boost your concentration and logic with every color sort challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unwind and relieve stress with highly satisfying magic sort puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Feel accomplished every time you clear a level.\\u003cbr\\u003e• The ideal daily brain exercise for ball sort game lovers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the magic sort adventure today. Download Ball Sort Magic: Color Puzzle for endless ball sort game fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eContact us:\\u003cbr\\u003e📞 Tel: +44 7594816412\\u003cbr\\u003e📧 Email: passionfruit.customerservice@gmail.com\\u003cbr\\u003e📃 Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/passion-fruit-joy-pp/home\\u003cbr\\u003e📜 Terms of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/eulaofpassionfruitjoy/home\"],\"Passion Fruit Joy\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fqUyNCQUZrRDcx8paZCBdRCZSFAUNRcMnp7_CHal5qBewhG8HJrmje0zXsk4iDeswHTMvYq2ojap1Ivhpjtf\"],null,[59,27,119,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[n