003dcom.billionairegames.woofmoomeow\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIWEoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgomCiBjb20uYmlsbGlvbmFpcmVnYW1lcy53b29mbW9vbWVvdxABGAMSDAoECAEQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"qyIn9hSSYHU\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:qyIn9hSSYHU?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:qyIn9hSSYHU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezn6bpWPT-oF4VIR2W7iE5MxLtvlXJglP-6triJPNj0sCfw8nSCFO7HYqhLVxG4-3mKGhsDJUaqhOa-2GZGkYecjTA7oi5wM2xCNZD1RmgRStYLIC_gqoJI4QaDjlRUgJ5gNHN_m-_boy-IuiS_X4fLx7sdwXYOC-KkEN0FXokBL-Y1Q7IPVL-cD6WVkf8vetrDw0_gw1gC6yxGrBNgbZOzPr8liXDQtsoOKbZSbZxoKpnYHdb69aSrJxcsnbVBrAxfRqTlIzlpoPPdj7cOCjeIRdPL8TsUCPEwrg_BdehQ80g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qyIn9hSSYHU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Dogs, cows, and cats can all become heroes! Collect and grow a colorful cast of animal heroes, build your own party, and take on countless enemies and powerful bosses.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Collect Unique Animal Heroes\\u003cbr\\u003eAnimal heroes with different abilities and personalities are waiting for you. From sturdy heroes who hold back enemies on the front line, to powerful attackers and heroes who heal their allies! Collect a variety of animal heroes and build your perfect party.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Real-Time Battles with Animal Heroes in Action\\u003cbr\\u003eOnce the battle begins, your animal heroes charge onto the battlefield and fight enemies directly. Each hero moves and battles according to their own role and attack style. Watch your adorable animal heroes unleash lively, action-packed battles!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Different Combinations, Different Battles\\u003cbr\\u003eAttackers who deal heavy damage, defenders who withstand enemy attacks, and healers who keep allies in the fight. Your party\\u0026#39;s battle style changes depending on which heroes you bring together. Experiment with different combinations and build an even stronger party.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ The Fun of Growing Stronger\\u003cbr\\u003eUse Gold earned from battles to upgrade various stats such as Attack, Attack Speed, and Animal HP. Push your stats to the limit, raise your Tier, and challenge even more powerful enemies.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Defeat Powerful Bosses and Advance to the Next Stage\\u003cbr\\u003eAs battles continue, stronger enemies and bosses will appear. Stuck on a boss? Return to earlier stages, grow stronger, improve your hero combinations and stats, then challenge it again. The stronger you become, the higher the stages waiting for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Keep Growing Even While You\\u0026#39;re Away\\u003cbr\\u003eBattles and growth continue even when you\\u0026#39;re away from the game. Come back to collect accumulated rewards and continue your adventure with even stronger animal heroes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Contact Email: dcc_help@thebillionairegames.com\"],\"BillionaireGames\",\"5,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/N0ZYAOc3bNRYFHT-IDYrShPJaOjomCElb5mnsUWfZKk8boe6cMZl0IIIblP547yczZgtC8pmB0cUXdcTnDVF\"],null,[240,241,241,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]