le.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bg.link.balls.connect.puzzle.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bg.link.balls.connect.puzzle.game\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IXEoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQQorCiVjb20uYmcubGluay5iYWxscy5jb25uZWN0LnB1enpsZS5nYW1lEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Ball Connect Puzzle: Link Dots, a brain-teasing game that combines logic, strategy, and fun! Immerse yourself in a challenging experience where your goal is simple: connect the same colored balls without letting the lines cross. With many levels and tricky puzzles, this game is perfect for sharpening your mind.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach puzzle is a unique challenge that will test your problem-solving skills and spatial reasoning. As you progress, the grids get bigger and the challenges get trickier, requiring you to think ahead and plan your moves carefully. Can you connect all the dots and master every level?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eA wide variety of levels to keep you entertained for hours.\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple tap and drag mechanics make the game easy to learn but hard to master.\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the smooth, fluid design and the satisfying feeling of completing each puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003eA great way to challenge your mind and improve your strategic thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet Ball Connect Puzzle: Link Dots today and start connecting! See if you have what it takes to solve every puzzle in this addictive game.\"],\"Benno Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FjOOsqBFcTGxfZTI05o_7jZBXK49NBmZW0mW33rmRrDn6MozdiacZHQssw9QzYZbq8D8o1BZU43o7f4zRdUTfw\"],null,[171,230,255,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX