rFAWDelyM18ToSMSnuuiHj-Xzs9\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SJa3T8dZjdho_bFd2ytlj-E69g_LRREqOmO7gC_TDyMmVaeeUUopw7d9FQOVHuJpD0cntLOh_UcZC9-c2emm\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5ccus18OzxBzLMNPAyXuuW6fULV7bRacpk5_eIxPyCguqgSH36QGsvpAXM4Z1kqwalg1pVZgjIU6jzqSx5ODkA\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2PZJR7XjGopRCHsvOI8cIAxSKdSjZF-dFJVS5-X5IZj_WJ0dYs53YhV2MeGHsvsc6VW74DBfLdg2Je6Nws3Pq0s\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VuUJBmJPXkTAmF87wz3z4t0ewaH5xes3Z0QkI5Dr7VqZeUHaB5Dz1cYkhT8r8eouHNVDX4PMzAQuG_BythZU\"]]],\"Haunted Merge: Horror Story\",[\"4.3\",4.32],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIXUoTCIOmxrHHkJcDFQo9VAkdb+UGyvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNwohChtjb20ud2hhbGVqb3kuaG9ycm9yc3RvcnkuZ3AQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"IgTaB-tShew\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlDlR-kjtiTDccEjHSry3bXXWxkwLf6V5ZzCkBpwAp-HgWBwvY6rMybTuzVbCU1iIkXCV6VwABwPvD4sHmHWSRs9T1qKM0_65IqpkaoUOGtJxVkmGWIcUJhCp7tfFGDrbEplAfLZexDTsOA35rIjUoHNApcIx9882VT9xPobig2AeEr2-DHzqhuIeaYhPdYj-ZNZ3TbTJ9aQGRKbHFfYlsPB33TEX_CGgkmBxRtnDl5rUJPLFcBBfePRzkUDpE2gZ1riF1InoJ27Zf-tri1cXeFeuONDIK3cENJh8x-nD9AVw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IgTaB-tShew/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u0026quot;You don\\u0026#39;t see them... but they see you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’re an orphan, raised by a wandering feng shui master who found you near a graveyard. Before he died, he handed you a locked box—the only clue to your past. After burying him, you begin your journey to uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eYour first lead brings you to a run-down apartment building. You move in as a tenant—but something is deeply wrong.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The elevator opens by itself—on floors no one pressed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- An empty unit echoes with whispers that don’t exist.\\u003cbr\\u003e- A cursed construction site keeps taking lives...\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat starts as a ghost story becomes something far more disturbing.\\u003cbr\\u003eBecause sometimes, the real horror isn’t the ghost—it’s the people.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eFace your fears and uncover long-buried secrets\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge clues to reveal hidden truths\\u003cbr\\u003eLook closely - every detail could crack the case\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve puzzles and relax through a hauntingly original experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDare to look deeper?\\u003cbr\\u003eYour parents are gone. But why?\\u003cbr\\u003eIs it a curse… or a cover-up?\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you tell what’s real - and what’s a setup?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe deaths keep coming. Accidents? Or something worse?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for players who:\\u003cbr\\u003eLove creepy folktales and chilling mysteries\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy merge mechanics with a twist\\u003cbr\\u003eAre drawn to stories about the dark side of human nature\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is your only way out.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Haunted Merge: Horror Story\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge the evidence. Uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eExpose the terrifying secrets buried behind every story they tried to erase.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/HauntedMergeGames\"],\"WhaleJoy Game Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0J-mq5H4QCThfEQvEoKHXaxMMob0O6a0FxJfT5WvqXTbBLOtZwwhmy3eewvCOJkmznnuykYnYu424DPKBYUq5w\"],null,[18,20,18,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Horror\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.98 - $139.98 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"net.wyvernware.whosthealien\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CysIxdUImsZN5hkik41vmf8KNOoOK5aW9XVGrOVgE27Alcv6RtoC1OZEzjr8gRGUk1h1c0KYStYp8ZVph1Rw1Q\"],null,[65,163,253,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hMZ8ZZqEl6vjLlENi4N4Yvx_4K1ptdcjB1fdJpCUUxPwHk-Lqbs-nkwbCEP1DG-wLceQUtGupBfk9kjfdTwWlA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6WTkywGzu16eg17_W-sBh6TpUcr6KCshLZroTqU0PYK9IALNjjg1UL8hLJqRyzQo3_6UMYkUG