ump, run and shape transform switch game? Get ready for an exciting adventure where transforming functions meet racing fun in a convertor shape game. This transforming game offers you a thrilling experience in shape running and shape transform race with multiple tracks like land, air, and sea. Run fast and you\\u0026#39;ll need to jump through a variety of transformations like car 🚗, parachute 🪂, boat 🚤, scooter 🛵, bicycle 🚲, tank, quad bike, heavy bike 🏍️, airplane 🛩️, and snow van 🚐.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTransform 3D shape shift games bring the rush of transforming simulator fun and fast-paced racing adventure that requires quick decision-making to reach the finish line.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLets start the shape evolution game where you\\u0026#39;ll explore the art of race and become the expert of shape transform race game. In this bike race game, you have to quickly change the shape of character into different vehicles. If you don\\u0026#39;t make it perfect shape on the time, you lose and have to start over.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe gameplay is very easy. Just tap on the screen, select the convertor shape vehicle, and jump shape change your appearance in a fun race. You’ll join an exciting shape transform race with many obstacles and complicated terrain by passing through complex tracks. Each vehicle offers unique advantages, fun gameplay, and challenges for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShape Transform: Shifting Car Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e🛩️ Simple one-touch controls of a transform game.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚤 Play with one hand.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 Jump shape run can be enjoyed by all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏍️ Easy to play.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚐 Exciting levels with shape running environments.\\u003cbr\\u003e🪂 Transform into multiple shapes for fun racing.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚲 Satisfying and fun gameplay for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏃\\u200d♂️ Get ready to play Shape Transform: Shifting Car and join the ultimate adventure. Accept the challenge to become the race winner in this transforming simulator game by completing the fun racing game challenge.\"],\"Rebel Actions\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3sWDkwRXJn6vXA44d8iQ3mI4EKj69zpi8yPonafIfxvj_QofPMpx8-pp__CDUGqN70WVpSNJpOfrDt734wu_hQ\"],null,[63,254,1,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"SGD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.obg.shape.shift.race.master.shape.shifting.tranform.race.shapeshifting\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.obg.shape.shift.race.master.shape.shifting.tranform.race.shapeshifting\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$2.98 - $3.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.sprank.horror.beats.studio.battle\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VDLsGcg3ZDDIR0myU6BRBmjxH1eQ8A9GQRkwcfxsjipGDDUtRrZhz24zANyPhLcHlwEN9r6OKhrgYXm5HkF1rGI\"],null,[65,200,253,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[941,